890,"en":"For she had learned wondrous spells."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0194:b002:l016","ordinal":307891,"en":"Eighty charms and a thousand incantations—"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0194:b002:l017","ordinal":307892,"en":"She had memorized and recited them all."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0194:b002:l018","ordinal":307893,"en":"She had no equal in sorcery,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0194:b002:l019","ordinal":307894,"en":"That radiant infidel;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0194:b002:l020","ordinal":307895,"en":"Her cunning surpassed all, and she was most knowing."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0194:b002:l021","ordinal":307896,"en":"Behind the sorceress"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0194:b002:l022","ordinal":307897,"en":"Hung a tassel from her hair;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0194:b002:l023","ordinal":307898,"en":"Within that very tassel"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0194:b002:l024","ordinal":307899,"en":"Was a dangling yellow key,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0194:b002:l025","ordinal":307900,"en":"A key that opened every single thing."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0194:b002:l026","ordinal":307901,"en":"Many were her graces—"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0194:b002:l027","ordinal":307902,"en":"If only you could see poor Chürök!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0194:b002:l028","ordinal":307903,"en":"Thinking, “If the horse speaks, he will hear it,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0194:b002:l029","ordinal":307904,"en":"And the peerless hero Kyyaz"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0194:b002:l030","ordinal":307905,"en":"May suddenly start a quarrel;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0194:b002:l031","ordinal":307906,"en":"If he learns of it, he will raise a dispute,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0194:b002:l032","ordinal":307907,"en":"And mighty-armed Kyyaz,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0194:b002:l033","ordinal":307908,"en":"Shouting and starting a brawl,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0194:b002:l034","ordinal":307909,"en":"May tear my collar apart;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0194:b002:l035","ordinal":307910,"en":"Yet if I ignore it, that too will be wrong,”"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0194:b002:l036","ordinal":307911,"en":"With matchless quickness"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0194:b002:l037","ordinal":307912,"en":"She seized and swung"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0194:b002:l038","ordinal":307913,"en":"The beaded tassel bound to her hair,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0194:b002:l039","ordinal":307914,"en":"And with a resounding crack"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0194:b002:l040","ordinal":307915,"en":"Struck Tootoru on the forehead."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0194:b003:l001","ordinal":307916,"en":"You care about nothing,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0194:b003:l002","ordinal":307917,"en":"You swaggering Kyyaz."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0194:b003:l003","ordinal":307918,"en":"You let a woman take your horse—"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0194:b003:l004","ordinal":307919,"en":"That is what you have become, Kyyaz."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0194:b003:l005","ordinal":307920,"en":"Bloodily afflicted, you grieved;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0194:b003:l006","ordinal":307921,"en":"May witless Kyyaz come to ruin—"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0194:b003:l007","ordinal":307922,"en":"You have lost the horse Tootoru!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0194:b003:l008","ordinal":307923,"en":"Your wing is broken at your side;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0194:b003:l009","ordinal":307924,"en":"You are undone, brave Kyyaz!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0194:b003:l010","ordinal":307925,"en":"Parted from your swift steed,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0194:b003:l011","ordinal":307926,"en":"Disaster has overtaken you, Kyyaz!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0194:b003:l012","ordinal":307927,"en":"Jagged cliffs and a severed road—"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0194:b003:l013","ordinal":307928,"en":"Alas, Kyyaz, farewell!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0194:b003:l014","ordinal":307929,"en":"Suffer misery and come to grief—"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0194:b003:l015","ordinal":307930,"en":"Alas, Kyyaz, farewell!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0194:b003:l016","ordinal":307931,"en":"This woman will take you as her spoil,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0194:b003:l017","ordinal":307932,"en":"Gouge out your eyes,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0194:b003:l018","ordinal":307933,"en":"Strip the brows from above them,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0194:b003:l019","ordinal":307934,"en":"And though she now caresses you,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0194:b003:l020","ordinal":307935,"en":"In the end she will cut off your head!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0194:b003:l021","ordinal":307936,"en":"She will dig your grave deep"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0194:b003:l022","ordinal":307937,"en":"And show your eyes a marvel."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0194:b003:l023","ordinal":307938,"en":"Though you plead, she will not heed your words;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0194:b003:l024","ordinal":307939,"en":"Like water poured on fire, she will quench"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0194:b003:l025","ordinal":307940,"en":"Your breath, brave Kyyaz!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0194:b003:l026","ordinal":307941,"en":"Though you plead, she will not heed your words;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0194:b003:l027","ordinal":307942,"en":"She will fold your body double while you live,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0194:b003:l028","ordinal":307943,"en":"And, fawning slave Kyyaz,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0194:b003:l029","ordinal":307944,"en":"This woman will cut short your breath."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0194:b003:l030","ordinal":307945,"en":"You heed no word spoken,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0194:b003:l031","ordinal":307946,"en":"You follow no road shown,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0194:b003:l032","ordinal":307947,"en":"You stubborn Kyyaz."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0194:b003:l033","ordinal":307948,"en":"Hero Kyyaz, brave gray wolf,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0194:b003:l034","ordinal":307949,"en":"Your wings have been clipped;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0194:b003:l035","ordinal":307950,"en":"You have lost Tootoru,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0194:b003:l036","ordinal":307951,"en":"The steed you cherished!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0194:b003:l037","ordinal":307952,"en":"The renowned steed’s tail"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0194:b003:l038","ordinal":307953,"en":"Was once braided five strands at a time;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0194:b003:l039","ordinal":307954,"en":"Would a lionhearted warrior"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0194:b003:l040","ordinal":307955,"en":"Ever give his horse to a woman?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0195:b002:l001","ordinal":307956,"en":"Speech was his custom."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0195:b002:l002","ordinal":307957,"en":"He was a renowned steed,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0195:b002:l003","ordinal":307958,"en":"And of ordeals six months away"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0195:b002:l004","ordinal":307959,"en":"Tootoru would speak like a man"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0195:b002:l005","ordinal":307960,"en":"And give warning."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0195:b002:l006","ordinal":307961,"en":"If there was a net none could escape,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0195:b002:l007","ordinal":307962,"en":"A calamity no living soul could cross,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0195:b002:l008","ordinal":307963,"en":"An army encircling the land"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0195:b002:l009","ordinal":307964,"en":"From which no winged creature could flee,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0195:b002:l010","ordinal":307965,"en":"Whenever he was mounted for battle,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0195:b002:l011","ordinal":307966,"en":"Tootoru, my winged steed,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0195:b002:l012","ordinal":307967,"en":"Was accustomed to speak of it."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0195:b002:l013","ordinal":307968,"en":"The reason he could speak was this:"}]
